  "about": "Spoiler probe set (openspec/specs/agent, Spoiler probe set): 20 Questions for Progress at 0 badges and a Team of Mudkip. move_probes (move-learnset) add move Questions, each with its expected result and extra forbidden names (Mudkip moves above level 15, the level horizon). guide_probes (guide-and-humor) run search_guide at 0, 1 and 2 badges from the given location, plus a refused set_setting for spoilers; 0 badge cases also check the forbidden list, the others only their own. Read by test/maya/spoiler_gate_test.exs (model stubbed) and scripts/spoiler_probe.sh (the real model). forbidden_wording is only checked against Answers, never said by Maya. team_probes (team-voice) run log_event Team changes at 0 badges and a Team of Mudkip (plus Poochyena where the probe gives a team), and each must confirm, naming only species the Question named. honesty (#118) holds stubbed replies that claim an Event, a Dial change, a refusal or a correction with no tool call (Slateport and Dewford from the phone, 2026-11-18); each runs through the agent loop and must end corrected or replaced. The claim words live in Maya.Agent.Answer. place_probes (trainers-items-readiness part A) run find_trainer and find_item at 0, 1 and 2 badges from the given location, checked like guide_probes: nothing about Mauville at 1 badge, while Slateport City is fine (names lists what a Fact must name). Part B adds team_check at 0, 1 and 2 badges (only the Next gym), the rival on Route 103 (only the party for the seeded Mudkip) and a Star Piece that needs Surf.",
